   "lines": [
    "3 hour examination",
    "in the morning.",
    "In afternoon went",
    "out to Chestnut",
    "Hill to pass Sunday.",
    "I spent most of the",
    "evening with Mr.",
    "Saltonstall, looking",
    "over his old family",
    "papers, comparing",
    "our Egyptian and",
    "Syrian experiences",
    "and talking over",
    "things in general.",
    "Tom Lee came in and",
    "we had a grand theol-",
    "-ogical discussion."
